# Static artifact repo (customer_web_build)

- This repo is the **static Cloudflare Pages** source for the customer frontend. **`main` is production.**
- **Do not implement app features here.** Application work belongs in sibling `../customer_ordereasy_njs`.
- Updates come from the **deploy-frontend** flow in `customer_ordereasy_njs`: build → replace contents (keep `.git`) → feature branch → **PR into `main`** → merge after approval.
- Never commit/push directly to `main`. Never merge without ≥1 approval.
- Never force-push `main`.
